Warning: Jet.InferredNeverReturn: Public function `exit_now` always diverges but does not declare `Never`
  --> Tests/UILint/inferred_never_transitive.jet:7:1
    |
  7 | exit_now: fn(code: Int) {
    | ^^^^^^^^
 Why: Inferred divergence is useful to callers but is not part of the written API contract
 Fix: Write `-> Never` as the return type, for example `exit_now: fn() -> Never`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.InferredNeverReturn

